<% content_for :title, "New API token" %>
<h1>New API token</h1>

<p>Copy this token now and give it to your agent. It won't be shown again.</p>
<p><code id="new-api-token"><%= @api_token.token %></code></p>

<dl>
  <dt>Name</dt><dd><%= @api_token.name %></dd>
  <dt>Access</dt><dd><%= ApiToken::PERMISSIONS[@api_token.permission] %></dd>
</dl>

<p>Your agent sends it in the <code>Authorization: Bearer …</code> header. See the <%= link_to "API documentation", api_v1_docs_path %>.</p>
<p><%= link_to "Back to settings", edit_settings_path %></p>
